      "writtenOn": "2026-07-20T21:17:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "From my understanding `pm_device_runtime_get()` is synchronous.  So the call to `shi_ite_pm_cb()` should complete before `pm_device_runtime_get()` returns.",
